  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R11_Enhancing Security and Safety for the Girl Child in the Liptako Gourma region (Mali, Niger, and Burkina Faso)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing security and safety for the girl child through full protection from all forms of exploitation and access to quality education in the Liptako Gourma region&#x201d; (Mali, Niger, and Burkina Faso). The initial phase will be implemented in Burkina Faso with possibility for scaling up to the Liptako Gourma region during the second year and upon availability of the required resources</narrative>
  </description>
