   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">A knowledge document is produced and launched in 2025 on on the impact of formal and alternative education in conflict-affected regions of the Sahel</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development of knowledge materials on the impact of formal and alternative education in conflict-affected regions of the Sahel is crucial to understanding how education can act as a stabilizing force in volatile environments. In regions experiencing conflict, access to quality education provides a sense of normalcy and protection for children, while also equipping them with the skills needed for future resilience. By documenting the outcomes and challenges of both formal and alternative education pathways, these materials will inform strategies to enhance educational opportunities, improve protection mechanisms, and support long-term recovery and peacebuilding efforts in the Sahel region.</narrative>
    </description>
